  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>30</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>30</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now rewriting the above expression we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>30</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>29</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>29</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>28</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>27</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now adding both the equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>30</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>30</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>30</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>30</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>60</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>,</p><p>We get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p>",
